{
  "_comment": [
    "THE FRONTIER-MODEL BRIDGE ROSTER — data, not code.",
    "",
    "The Claude bridge was never Claude-shaped: it is a coding agent with repo",
    "access, spawned headless, told to read .claude/skills/bridge-listen/SKILL.md",
    "and answer the hive's pending asks over the broker. EVERY frontier CLI can",
    "do that, so every frontier CLI is a bridge — this file is the list of them.",
    "",
    "It is JSON rather than a .cjs module for the same reason a provider is a",
    "spec: these vendors change their flags faster than this repo learns them,",
    "and fixing a bridge must never mean editing code. Add a vendor by adding an",
    "entry; nothing else in the system learns its name.",
    "",
    "FIELDS",
    "  id          registry id. Becomes the provider id (agent-bridge transport).",
    "  label       what a participant calls it in the providers console.",
    "  vendor      colour family; must be one VENDOR_BODY knows, else it lands",
    "              in `local` (see provider-spec.ts vendorOf).",
    "  bin         executable to look for on PATH. On Windows the probe also",
    "              tries <bin>.cmd / .exe / .ps1 — npm shims are .cmd.",
    "  versionArgs argv that proves it is installed and answers fast.",
    "  argv        the headless invocation. {prompt} and {model} are replaced;",
    "              a {model} token in an entry with no model resolves to the",
    "              defaultModel. An argv element that is ONLY an unresolved",
    "              placeholder is dropped, so a flagless CLI still runs.",
    "  models      what this bridge can be asked for. `name` is the word a",
    "              participant types (/opus, /gemini); `id` is what the CLI is",
    "              given; tier is deep|balanced|fast.",
    "  docsUrl     where to install it — the console's whole guided setup.",
    "",
    "Anything here that is NOT installed is simply not announced. Verified",
    "present on this machine: claude. The rest ship as ready-to-use defaults."
  ],
  "agents": [
    {
      "id": "claude-bridge",
      "label": "Claude Code",
      "vendor": "anthropic",
      "bin": "claude",
      "versionArgs": ["--version"],
      "argv": [
        "-p", "{prompt}",
        "--model", "{model}",
        "--permission-mode", "acceptEdits",
        "--allowedTools", "Bash Read Grep Glob",
        "--output-format", "text"
      ],
      "models": [
        { "name": "fable", "id": "claude-fable-5", "tier": "deep" },
        { "name": "opus", "id": "claude-opus-5", "tier": "deep" },
        { "name": "sonnet", "id": "claude-sonnet-5", "tier": "balanced" },
        { "name": "haiku", "id": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tier": "fast" }
      ],
      "defaultModel": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001",
      "docsUrl": "https://claude.com/claude-code"
    },
    {
      "id": "codex-bridge",
      "label": "Codex",
      "description": "Answers through Codex CLI using the ChatGPT account signed in on this machine. No API key is stored in Hypercomb.",
      "account": "ChatGPT subscription",
      "vendor": "openai",
      "bin": "codex",
      "usageProbe": "codex-app-server",
      "versionArgs": ["--version"],
      "argv": [
        "exec", "{prompt}",
        "-m", "{model}",
        "--sandbox", "workspace-write",
        "--skip-git-repo-check"
      ],
      "models": [
        { "name": "codex", "label": "GPT-5.6 Sol", "id": "gpt-5.6-sol", "tier": "deep" },
        { "name": "codex-mini", "label": "GPT-5.6 Luna", "id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "tier": "fast" }
      ],
      "defaultModel": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "docsUrl": "https://developers.openai.com/codex/cli"
    },
    {
      "id": "gemini-bridge",
      "label": "Gemini CLI",
      "vendor": "google",
      "bin": "gemini",
      "versionArgs": ["--version"],
      "argv": [
        "-p", "{prompt}",
        "-m", "{model}",
        "--yolo"
      ],
      "models": [
        { "name": "gemini-pro", "id": "gemini-2.5-pro", "tier": "deep" },
        { "name": "gemini", "id": "gemini-2.5-flash", "tier": "balanced" }
      ],
      "defaultModel": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "docsUrl": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli"
    },
    {
      "id": "cursor-bridge",
      "label": "Cursor Agent",
      "vendor": "openai",
      "bin": "cursor-agent",
      "versionArgs": ["--version"],
      "argv": [
        "-p", "{prompt}",
        "--model", "{model}",
        "--force",
        "--output-format", "text"
      ],
      "models": [
        { "name": "cursor", "id": "auto", "tier": "balanced" }
      ],
      "defaultModel": "auto",
      "docsUrl": "https://cursor.com/cli"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-bridge",
      "label": "Copilot CLI",
      "vendor": "openai",
      "bin": "copilot",
      "versionArgs": ["--version"],
      "argv": [
        "-p", "{prompt}",
        "--model", "{model}",
        "--allow-all-tools"
      ],
      "models": [
        { "name": "copilot", "id": "claude-sonnet-4.5", "tier": "balanced" }
      ],
      "defaultModel": "claude-sonnet-4.5",
      "docsUrl": "https://github.com/github/copilot-cli"
    },
    {
      "id": "grok-bridge",
      "label": "Grok CLI",
      "vendor": "xai",
      "bin": "grok",
      "versionArgs": ["--version"],
      "argv": [
        "-p", "{prompt}",
        "-m", "{model}"
      ],
      "models": [
        { "name": "grok", "id": "grok-4", "tier": "deep" },
        { "name": "grok-fast", "id": "grok-4-fast", "tier": "fast" }
      ],
      "defaultModel": "grok-4",
      "docsUrl": "https://github.com/superagent-ai/grok-cli"
    },
    {
      "id": "qwen-bridge",
      "label": "Qwen Code",
      "vendor": "local",
      "bin": "qwen",
      "versionArgs": ["--version"],
      "argv": [
        "-p", "{prompt}",
        "-m", "{model}",
        "--yolo"
      ],
      "models": [
        { "name": "qwen", "id": "qwen3-coder-plus", "tier": "balanced" }
      ],
      "defaultModel": "qwen3-coder-plus",
      "docsUrl": "https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code"
    },
    {
      "id": "opencode-bridge",
      "label": "opencode",
      "vendor": "local",
      "bin": "opencode",
      "versionArgs": ["--version"],
      "argv": [
        "run", "{prompt}",
        "-m", "{model}"
      ],
      "models": [
        { "name": "opencode", "id": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-5", "tier": "balanced" }
      ],
      "defaultModel": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-5",
      "docsUrl": "https://opencode.ai"
    }
  ]
}
